      "widgets_values": [
        "One continuous cinematic shot continuing the exact same garden courtyard. Begin at the same low camera position, with the same woman in the dark green coat seated on the wooden bench at the right. A new courier wearing a bright orange rain jacket enters from the left, pushing a red bicycle along the garden path. The blue winged dog returns from the right and approaches the bicycle, sniffing its front wheel, then sits beside the courier. The woman stands up from her bench and greets the courier with a small wave. During this action the camera smoothly rises from ground level to human eye level and arcs left around the group by about 45 degrees, ending in a medium three-quarter view of the courier, dog and woman with the bench farther behind them. Keep the same garden, people and objects physically consistent while revealing the new angle. Natural continuous movement, no cuts, no dissolves, no sudden camera jump. Quiet birds, pawsteps and bicycle tire sounds, no music, no dialogue.",
